{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03847","headline":"奉和受图温洛应制 · 苏味道","name":"奉和受图温洛应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿绮膺河检，清坛俯洛滨。\n天旋俄制跸，孝享属严禋。\n陟配光三祖，怀柔洎百神。\n雾开中道日，雪歛属车尘。\n预奉咸英奏，长歌亿万春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}